1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,510
A robot can push around an obstacle from either side, but not through it.
机器人可以从障碍两侧绕行，却不能穿过去。

2
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:10,670
Averaging those demonstrations can produce an action that belongs to neither valid strategy.
将示教平均，可能得到不属于任何有效策略的动作。

3
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:16,190
Diffusion Policy learns a distribution of action sequences instead of one averaged answer.
扩散策略学习动作序列分布，而非平均答案。

4
00:00:16,764 --> 00:00:21,684
During training, noise is added to demonstrated action sequences at different levels.
训练时，对示教动作序列加入不同程度噪声。

5
00:00:22,104 --> 00:00:26,364
The network learns to predict that noise using the current observation as context.
网络根据当前观测条件，学习预测所加噪声。

6
00:00:26,964 --> 00:00:31,604
This trains a conditional action model, not an explicit contact-force estimator.
这训练条件动作模型，不是显式接触力估计器。

7
00:00:32,122 --> 00:00:37,222
At deployment, a random action block is repeatedly denoised into a plausible sequence.
部署时，随机动作块经反复去噪成为可行序列。

8
00:00:37,682 --> 00:00:41,562
The robot executes only a short part before observing and planning again.
机器人只执行短段，然后重新观察和规划。

9
00:00:42,002 --> 00:00:46,702
This rolling process combines coherent motion with opportunities to respond to changes.
滚动过程兼顾运动连贯性和应对变化的机会。

10
00:00:47,391 --> 00:00:51,771
The robot must align a T-shaped block and then move into an ending region.
机器人要对齐T形物体，再进入结束区域。

11
00:00:52,211 --> 00:00:56,211
That final motion matters because it signals that the manipulation is complete.
最后这段运动很重要，它标记操作完成。

12
00:00:56,671 --> 00:01:01,811
The real experiment uses one hundred thirty-six demonstrations rather than unlimited expert data.
真机实验使用136条示教，并非无限专家数据。

13
00:01:02,364 --> 00:01:08,444
The visual diffusion policy achieves point-eight-zero overlap and ninety-five percent success.
视觉扩散策略交并比0.80，成功率95%。

14
00:01:09,064 --> 00:01:14,264
The LSTM comparison reports twenty percent success under the same real-world protocol.
同一真机协议下，LSTM对照成功率20%。

15
00:01:14,984 --> 00:01:19,864
Twenty trials support this comparison; overlap is a dimensionless geometric score.
该比较共20次试验，交并比是无量纲分数。

16
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:25,690
The author demonstrations include interruptions and perturbations during pushing and finishing.
作者演示包含推动与结束阶段的干扰。

17
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:30,150
Repeated observations can change the next action chunk when the scene moves.
场景变化后，新观测能改变下一动作块。

18
00:01:30,990 --> 00:01:35,770
Selected successful recoveries do not guarantee recovery from every unseen contact state.
展示成功恢复不等于所有未见接触都能恢复。

19
00:01:36,256 --> 00:01:43,576
Multiple denoising steps consume computation, and behavior cloning remains limited by demonstrated coverage.
多步去噪消耗计算，行为克隆仍受示教覆盖限制。

20
00:01:43,976 --> 00:01:49,096
Visual and privileged-state results must stay separate when evaluating what the camera provides.
评价相机能力时，视觉与特权状态结果必须分开。

21
00:01:49,596 --> 00:01:53,636
The extended paper adds experiments beyond the original conference version.
扩展论文还增加了原会议稿之外的实验。

22
00:01:54,264 --> 00:01:59,304
The contribution is a better way to represent and update multimodal robot behavior.
贡献在于更好表示和更新多模态机器人行为。

23
00:01:59,984 --> 00:02:04,804
Its task gains cannot be converted into millimeter accuracy or reliable force control.
任务收益不能换算成毫米精度或可靠力控制。

24
00:02:05,324 --> 00:02:11,004
For delicate manipulation, pair action generation with the sensing the contact actually needs.
精细操作还要给动作生成配上接触所需的感知。
